Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在亲兄弟面前  你选择与恶魔为伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose a demon over your own brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我干的  我触发了天启并释放了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it. i started the apocalypse, and i set lucifer free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会献出任何东西  任何\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would give anything... anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能回到从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你和我  是拍档的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna be a team, you and i,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.13,0:00:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要互相体谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be a two-way street.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要搞定我们面前的拦路虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to just grab on to whatever's in front of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉它  结束这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick its ass, and go down fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我接受这建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get on board with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(阿莱恩斯  内布拉斯加州)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:33.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你应该上床睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啊  因为我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. i'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:38.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  番茄酱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this -- ketchup?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.34,0:01:39.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.98,0:01:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! you're mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸妈付钱就是叫我来对付你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what your parents pay me for -- to be mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在快去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bed -- now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait. wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果让我摸下你的胸  我就去睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go to bed if you let me touch your boob.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我送安珀回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh, take Amber home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别等我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.89,0:03:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗朗辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francine!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:28.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裴吉探员和派莱特探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents page and plant, FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们  有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen. what brings you by?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.73,0:03:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要看安珀·格里尔的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to see Amber Greer's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  看这干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警方报告上说有东西把她开了瓢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police report said something clawed through her skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没读过验尸报告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't read the autopsy report
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天早上就发给你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That i e-mailed out this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的服务器有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we had, uh, server issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把她带来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they brought her in,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:03.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为她被狼或其他什么袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought she was attacked by a wolf or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一片受压变形的指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a press-on nail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在她的颞叶上发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found it in her temporal lobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:18.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你是不是说这是她自己做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, are you -- you saying that she did this to herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她把自己脑袋给抓破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. she scratched her brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这得花点时间  痛不欲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd take hours, and it'd hurt like hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.81,0:04:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但肯定  这是有可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sure -- it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.05,0:04:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:28.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你们的简称  民防局  医疗保障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick your acronym... OCD PCP
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都叫做"发疯"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all spells "crazy."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是某种幻觉上身\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess -- some kind of phantom itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:36.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个很极端的案例\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, an extreme case, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幻觉搔痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phantom itch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人一谈到痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it takes is someone talking about an itch --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者一想到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or thinking about one, even --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然间你就忍不住想抓痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suddenly you can't stop scratching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:48.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  有些问题也许会有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now, some of these questions might seem a bit odd,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但请与我配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}But please just bear with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你注意到屋子有变冷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you noticed any cold spots in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  那有没有奇怪的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, what about strange smells?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you lookin' for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吉米对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh... Jimmy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安珀是你的保姆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Amber was your babysitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的大多数保姆都糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, most of my babysitters sucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是克兰西小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially Ms. Chancey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.19,0:05:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她只关心两件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only cared about two things --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:33.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“神龙祖玛”和睡觉时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}"dynasty" and bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.19,0:05:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚你见过什么奇怪的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you, uh, you see anything strange that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.93,0:05:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我发现什么  我会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i would tell you if i knew something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:48.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我百分之百答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise -- 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以我的灵魂起誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Jimmy, i, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}...i happen to know you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来说说真心话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna start talking truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则你和我就要去市中心逛逛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you and me gonna have to take a little trip downtown?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:15.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小孩说他在保姆的梳子里放了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid said he put this on the babysitter's hairbrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:16.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  一般的搔痒是没有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, there's no way itching powder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使这女孩把脑给抓破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made that girl scratch her brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是些碾碎的枫树种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just ground-up maple seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有些其他的想法  和他们去说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have any other theories, i'm open to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:39.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人触电死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy got electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是电线外漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, maybe a loose wire
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.73,0:06:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者设备短路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a piece of equipment shorted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在  我们还没找到任何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, we haven't found anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.73,0:06:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目击者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witnesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里  斯坦利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, guy in there -- Mr. Stanley.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he saw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他闭口不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not making a lick of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.59,0:06:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人老珠黄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯坦利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Mr. Stanley?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道那东西会起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know it would really work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would work?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:15.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All i did...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是和他握手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was shake his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切就绪  巫师先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it, Mr. Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真成猪肉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll do, pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:07:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么名堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这垃圾应该没这么大能耐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That crap isn't supposed to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:06.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连电池也省了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing doesn't even have batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...so, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了一个被诅咒的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are -- are we looking at cursed objects?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.41,0:08:11.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这镇上还有个魔法女巫也说不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's a powerful witch in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢乐蜂鸣器和瘙痒粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any link between the, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有什么联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}The joy buzzer and the itching powder?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:27.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个产自中国  另一个是墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, one was made in China, the other Mexico,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过都在同一个地方进货\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they were both bought from the same store.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到conjurarium\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the conjurarium,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神秘和魔幻的圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanctum of magic and mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是店长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You the owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:09.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近你卖出过瘙痒粉和欢乐蜂鸣器没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold any itching powder or joy buzzers lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:12.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  每样都卖出去一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a grand total of one of each.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可买不起高价货\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't exactly big-ticket items.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是来买东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you boys here to buy something
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是另有他事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  你这里生意很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you get many customers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:23.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们喜欢来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们不会买太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't buy much,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们更喜欢一些暴力的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're more than happy to break stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们只关心他们的苹果手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}These days, all they care about are their iphones
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那些吸血鬼和接吻的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those kissing-vampire movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这让我太\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole thing makes me just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  对  愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I am angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我苦心经营这家店20余年\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shop has been my life for 20 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而今它却分文不值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's wasting away to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就恨他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why you hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:46.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就希望你得干点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish there was something you could do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  你就用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're taking revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报复他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}...with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这位老兄不是那个巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me this guy is not a powerful witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这颗牙齿放在你枕头下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just slip this tooth under your pillow,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.17,0:10:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你睡着后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And while you're asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牙仙就会下凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tooth fairy will float down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向你拿走一颗犬牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And swap it out for a quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我睡着后一些怪物就会来我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}So some freak is gonna come in my room while I'm sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿走我的牙齿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take my tooth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像被轻轻地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might feel just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掐了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我呢  很感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I, uh, appreciate that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佛里蒙特护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse...Fremont.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请叫我珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please -- call me "Jen."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  你叫珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. "Jen" it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没牙的这家伙怎样了  口腔里的都差不多没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with toothless? Cavity creeps get ahold of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.01,0:12:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是他写下来的描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wrote up a description --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高五尺一寸  体重350磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}5'10", 350 pounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有翅膀  身穿粉红芭蕾舞裙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wings, and a pink tutu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似是牙仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said it was the tooth fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:23.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他确实被止痛药整得一塌糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's obviously whacked out on painkillers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么说  它都是在没触动到防盗装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it was got past locked doors and windows
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能进入到门窗锁着的房间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without triggering the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有搞错  牙仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. The tooth fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且还在他枕头底下留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it left 32 quarters underneath his pillow --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,32颗犬牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}One for each tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我看你是疯了而且还要给你来点更猛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I will see your crazy and raise you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.61,0:12:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,楼下有几个小孩儿胃溃烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a couple of kids upstairs with stomach ulcers --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把跳跳糖混了可乐一起喝了(大人骗小孩这样会爆炸)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say they got it from mixing pop rocks and coke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的脸很恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}His face froze that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么个恐怖法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:13:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这个表情  僵持了很久  一动不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, uh, held it too long, and it -- it stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们准备为他做个整形手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're flying in a plastic surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你这么说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I mean, if you add all that up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.07,0:13:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得真的有海底小精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought sea-monkeys were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他们就是丰年虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are. They're brine shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  不是  我是说像广告里说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I mean like in the ads.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海猿妈妈在家里炖着肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like the sea-monkey wife cooks the pot roast
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着海猿爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the sea-monkey husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海猿宝宝就跟小狗一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the sea-monkey kids play with the dog
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在海猿城堡里  这些都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a sea-monkey castle -- real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时我才6岁  不过我全信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was 6, but I believed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.32,0:13:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能这其中有某些联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's the connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.59,0:13:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牙仙  跳跳糖混可乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tooth fairy, the pop rocks and coke,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有欢乐蜂鸣器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The joy buzzer that shocks you --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是假的  但孩子们信\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all lies that kids believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:41.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这些却都成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they're coming true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  不管是什么促成的  这就是重造现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so whatever's doing this is -- is reshaping reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能做上帝会做的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has the powers of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是  魔术师的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...of a trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  还有9岁小屁孩的幽默感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, with the sense of humor of a 9-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老哥  说真的  你怎么还在吃那个火腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, seriously -- still with the ham?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没冰箱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牙仙攻击了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, tooth fairy attack was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.93,0:14:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃跳跳糖和可乐的在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop rocks and coke was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你找到了瘙痒粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you've got itching powder,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怖的脸和conjurarium\N{\fnArial\fs30}face freeze, and conjurarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在这2英里范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}All located within a 2-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:21.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们进入了一个离奇爆炸地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we got a blast zone of weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在里面幻想会成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}And inside, fantasy becomes reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么力量在它中心地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's the a-bomb at its center?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四英亩的农田和一栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four acres of farmland... and a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的旅馆可能不在那个圈子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our motel isn't in that circle, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.79,0:14:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, d-dude --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我想的那样  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what i think it is, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无聊了  那个护士很火辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got bored. that nurse was hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你也可能因此失明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you can go blind from that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我五分钟  我们去查下那房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me five minutes. we'll go check out that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.91,0:15:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  不要用我的剃须刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do not use my razor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么我能帮你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can i help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.15,0:15:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. uh, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:50.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.06,0:15:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}...fbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么你们这些家伙都不敲门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you guys don't knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父母在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are your parents home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你介意我们问你一些问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you mind if we ask you a few questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能还要检查下周围的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe take a look around the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:07.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  你应该相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. you can trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是官员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把它加热  然后喝了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heat it up, and you eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对的  我知道  只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. i-i know. it's just, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我小时候我也常为自己做主食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to make my own dinner, too, when i was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:38.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我可不是小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, i'm not a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  不是  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. no, i-i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说下  我是罗伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm robert, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰西  很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:49.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是你画的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you draw this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是牙仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the tooth fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你想象的牙仙的样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you think the tooth fairy looks like, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. my dad told me about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  难道你爸爸没有告诉过你关于牙仙的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, didn't your dad tell you about the tooth fairy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸告诉我各种各样的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad told me different stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牙仙可不是一个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the tooth fairy isn't a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰西  你知道痒粉是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about itching powder, jesse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西会让你抓烂自己的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stuff will make you scratch your brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跳跳糖和可乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop rocks and coke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你混合它们  然后你就该进医院和生命说再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mix them, and you'll end up in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都知道那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.29,0:17:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该拥有那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会电死你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can electrocute you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  它不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.93,0:17:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它只是个发条玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a wind-up toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没伤害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's totally harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至没有电池的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't even have batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以它不会电击到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it can't shock you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  完全不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.98,0:17:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是它能做的一切只是握在你手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, all it does is just shake in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点蹩脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.85,0:17:54.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能再说一次你的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say your name was, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一种直觉  我感受得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a hunch. i went with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你因为直觉拿我冒险  - 你没事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You risked my ass on a hunch? - You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有现在我们知道是谁弄得这个镇团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, now we know who's turning this town into willy wonk
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.37,0:18:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是  所有事杰西都相信会成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. everything jesse believes comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他认为牙仙长得像贝鲁西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks the tooth fairy looks like belushi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢乐蜂鸣器真的会电击到人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joy buzzers really shock people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隆的一声  那就是前些天发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom. that's what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.51,0:18:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是要让他相信欢乐蜂鸣器并不会真的起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but convince him the joy buzzers don't actually work,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们就会从杀人机器倒回到废物玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they go from killing machines back into crap toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能甚至不知道他在做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He probably doesn't even know he's doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎样做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到一些杰西的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, dug up what i could on jesse turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是学生  赢得过去年的松木比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, "b" student, won last year's pinewood derby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰西是被领养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse was adopted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.18,0:18:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的出身资料被密封着\N{\fnArial\fs30}His birth records are sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:18:59.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你拆封了它们还是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you unsealed them, and...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有列出父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no father listed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.08,0:19:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是杰西的亲生母亲叫朱莉娅·赖特\N{\fnArial\fs30}But jesse's biological mom is named julia wright.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她生活在麋鹿港  这个州的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives in elk creek, on the other side of the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你推销的是什么  我都没有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're selling, i'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是推销员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not salesmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裴吉探员和派莱特探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents page and plant, fbi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的证件塞进门缝里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your badge in the slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.29,0:19:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你搭档的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your partner's, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想要干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是有些关于你儿子的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just had a few questions... about your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他出生在1998年3月29日的奥马哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was born march 29, 1998, in omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把他给人领养了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put him up for adoption?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是觉得有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just wondering -- um, was it a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一个正常的孕育吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...was it a normal pregnancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有什么奇怪的事情发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there anything strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  赖特太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. wright, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.21,0:20:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想和你聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.09,0:20:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道有恶魔这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know about demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:58.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被附身过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:04.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔控制我身体  伤害人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon took control of my body, and I hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人的不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That -- that wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:13.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到一个女人向我求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard a woman beg for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉到年轻女孩的鲜血从我手中淌下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...felt a young girl's blood drip down my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:20.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道用盐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you knew about the salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.42,0:21:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我学了些技巧  恶魔控制了我好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I picked up tricks. It was in my head for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many months?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.91,0:21:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,9个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your son...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  所有阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah -- the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.97,0:21:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怀孕  生产\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pregnancy, birth --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.80,0:21:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个孕育过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子出生的那晚  我独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night the baby was born, I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种痛楚  让我痛不欲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the pain was -- the pain was overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大声尖叫  却变成了一阵狂笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I screamed, and it came out a laugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:57.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为恶魔很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the demon was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.93,0:22:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它利用我的身体来孕育孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used my body to give birth to a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.07,0:22:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等孩子出生后  变得不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it was over, something changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是恶魔累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the -- the demon was tired
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.21,0:22:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能是阵痛让我战胜了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if the pain helped me fight it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不知怎么地  我又被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Somehow, I took control.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.78,0:22:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔在我体内悲叹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the demon wailed inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断地击打着我的头骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pounded against my skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.85,0:22:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感到自己的头就快裂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought my head was gonna explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  突然之间灵光一闪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.26,0:22:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.44,0:22:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我和孩子独处时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I was alone with the baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,体内有种声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}A part of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:53.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of me wanted to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:23:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  老天救救我  我不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, god help me, I couldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:04.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我只能把孩子给人收养\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...I put it up for adoption...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后逃得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.76,0:23:09.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子的父亲是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the father?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们见过我儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.24,0:23:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.61,0:23:25.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.85,0:23:29.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在阿莱恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives in, uh,live in alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.42,0:23:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.76,0:23:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得去找帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你收到我们的消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you got our message.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能找到那男孩真是幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lucky you found the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.77,0:23:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  非常幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, real lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:56.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么处置他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.58,0:23:57.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.51,0:24:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.75,0:24:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子半人半魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}This child is half demon and half human,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他比人和魔都要强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's far more powerful than either.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.35,0:24:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他文明管他叫混合坎比翁或是犬夜叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other cultures call this hybrid cambion or katako.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他是异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know him as the antichrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.34,0:24:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.87,0:24:30.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁把那玩意放那里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:32.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之  我有点不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰西是恶魔的儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse is the devil's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.51,0:24:36.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.48,0:24:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的圣经错的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bible gets more wrong than it does right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.62,0:24:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,异教徒并不是路西法的信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The antichrist is not lucifer's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.82,0:24:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是恶魔之子罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just demon spawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.29,0:24:46.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但却是恶魔在与天使之战中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is one of the devil's greatest weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.39,0:24:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最强大的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the war against heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.89,0:24:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是杰西是恶魔的重要武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if jesse's a demonic howitzer,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.23,0:24:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他在内布拉斯加州干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what the hell's he doing in nebraska?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.83,0:24:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被恶魔弄丢了  恶魔找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons lost him. They can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.20,0:24:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们正在努力寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.53,0:24:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么会弄丢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they lost him because...?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.00,0:24:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为孩子的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the child's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.70,0:24:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使天使和恶魔都无法找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hides him from both angels and demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.81,0:25:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过只是暂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.87,0:25:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是他周围有个磁场\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's got, like, a force field around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.38,0:25:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那太好了  问题解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's great. Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随着路西法的苏醒  这孩子会越来越强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}With lucifer risen, this child grows strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用多久  他就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, he will do more
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.02,0:25:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅只是让一些玩具成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than just make a few toys come to life --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.52,0:25:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是会做些将恶魔引向他的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that will draw the demons to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.82,0:25:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔最终将会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons will find this child.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.29,0:25:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法能随心改造他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer will twist this boy to his purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.93,0:25:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  只需一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, with a word,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.93,0:25:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子就能杀死众天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}This child will destroy the host of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.43,0:25:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哇哇  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  杰西将会是对付天使的核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying that -- that jesse's gonna nuke the angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.91,0:25:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们决不允许此事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot allow that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.88,0:25:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.32,0:25:46.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能杀小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we don't just kill children.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.62,0:25:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的不顾一切让他们有机会赢得这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have done whatever it took to win this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.36,0:25:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.27,0:26:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  听着  我们不去杀他好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. hey, look, we are not going to kill him. all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们也不能把杰西留在这  这点我们都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can't leave jesse here either. we know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:08.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.04,0:26:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们带他去鲍比那里  他知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take him to bobby's. he'll know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.88,0:26:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是要绑架他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kidnap him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.45,0:26:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小镇上发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on in this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.11,0:26:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是在孩子高兴的情况下发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what happens when this thing is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.72,0:26:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是把他惹火了  后果将不堪设想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot imagine what it will do if it's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.69,0:26:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此外  你准备怎么扣留他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, how will you hold him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.09,0:26:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能立刻跑到世界另一端\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a thought, he could be halfway around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.69,0:26:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.70,0:26:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们告知他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we tell him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.63,0:26:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说杰西注定会成为敌对方  没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say jesse's destined to go dark side -- fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.93,0:26:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他现在还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he hasn't yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.47,0:26:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以既然一切都在于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we lay it all out for him --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.14,0:26:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在于他会在哪一方  天启  无数的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he is, the apocalypse, everything --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他会做出正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might make the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.75,0:26:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.75,0:26:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我不会再冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't take that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.99,0:27:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.11,0:27:19.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.72,0:27:21.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别怕  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's -- it's no worries. you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.32,0:27:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  不过是今天受了点  刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. it's just today -- a little...shaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  是因为温切斯特两兄弟的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. well, talking to the Winchesters will do that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.67,0:27:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我吗  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you recognize me, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.57,0:27:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时我们处得挺愉快的  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had some great times together, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.37,0:27:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到你偷偷的带走人  还把它藏了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you stole something from us, hid it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.67,0:27:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真是太  太顽皮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was very, very naughty of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.23,0:27:45.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们只好守株待兔  静观其变\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we watched, and we waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.17,0:27:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到如今\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.60,0:27:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们告诉你地址了  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told you where he is, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候该去拜访下咱俩的儿子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time we go and visit our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.48,0:28:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.84,0:28:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.34,0:28:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父母已经睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother and father are sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.52,0:28:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以肯定地告诉你  不到天亮他们是不会醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, they won't wake until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.13,0:29:00.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.21,0:29:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是有人在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a guy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿着风衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a trench coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.98,0:29:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.92,0:29:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.55,0:29:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.73,0:29:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我是怎么办到的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how did I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.83,0:29:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.76,0:29:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.83,0:30:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是你  除了你还有谁可以将人变成玩具小人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I mean, who else could turn someone into a toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.94,0:30:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're superman --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.51,0:30:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就只少了披风和马靴这些装备罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minus the cape and the go-go boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.99,0:30:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我搭档和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, my -- my partner and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.19,0:30:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,效力于一个秘密的政府机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}We work for a secret government agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.13,0:30:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作就是找寻拥有超能力的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our job to find kids with special powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.60,0:30:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  我们来这儿就是要带你\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, we're here to take you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.22,0:30:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到位于南达科塔州的秘密基地去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a hidden base in south dakota,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.49,0:30:27.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你有机会惩恶扬善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you'll be trained to fight evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.46,0:30:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像<变种特工>那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the x-men?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.71,0:30:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是<变种特工>那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly like the x-men.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.20,0:30:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  我们带你去见的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, the, uh, guy we're taking you to --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.62,0:30:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰好也是坐轮椅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's even in a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.76,0:30:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将成为一名英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.23,0:30:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将救助民众  将抱得美人归\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll save lives. you'll get the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.95,0:30:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听上去就很诱人  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.56,0:30:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们逗你玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖蹲角落去吧  编剧大师们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right there, dreamboat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.63,0:30:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,编故事确实能避免流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.00,0:30:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.97,0:30:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的掉以轻心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, on the other hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.21,0:31:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聪明反被聪明误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurting you's encouraged.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.51,0:31:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.02,0:31:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.08,0:31:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你长得真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.09,0:31:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继承了你父亲的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your father's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.62,0:31:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.67,0:31:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.17,0:31:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.57,0:31:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有一半的人类血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're half human...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.21,0:31:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有一半我们的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.47,0:31:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说得是恶魔  杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She means demons, Jesse!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.38,0:31:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被你称为父母的那两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people you call your parents --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.91,0:31:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也骗了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lied to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.96,0:31:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是他们的孩子  不是亲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not theirs -- not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.12,0:31:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但爸爸妈妈他们爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom and dad love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.22,0:31:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来他们整天把你一个人晾家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is -- is that why they leave you alone all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.67,0:31:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是因为他们爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they love you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.27,0:31:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙  那些骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people -- these imposters --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.48,0:31:52.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟你说过牙仙是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told you that the tooth fairy was real
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.15,0:31:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们警告过你那个玩具会伤害你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that your toys could hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.58,0:31:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们告诉过你还有成千上万的事都是假的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a hundred other things that aren't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.35,0:31:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是非常爱你  所以打造了个满是谎言的世界给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They love you so much, they made your whole life a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.35,0:32:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再自欺欺人了  杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look into your heart, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.12,0:32:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你早就知道自己非他们所生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always known you weren't theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.79,0:32:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早就知道自己有多么的特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always known you were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.60,0:32:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们全都在骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.13,0:32:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not FBI agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.50,0:32:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不是什么超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.19,0:32:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.20,0:32:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.84,0:32:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.78,0:32:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更可以为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.91,0:32:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.25,0:32:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只会把你当个孩子骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They treated you like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没人信任你  他们全都只会骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody trusted you. everybody's lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.02,0:32:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't that make you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.33,0:32:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧  你对此很生气嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? it does make you angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.34,0:32:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我对你说的全是事实  杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you the truth, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.34,0:32:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这世上没有了谎言不是会更好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't it be better if there were no lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.47,0:32:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.98,0:32:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就将有机会净化整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can wash it all clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.55,0:32:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让一切重头再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.01,0:33:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想象一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine that --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.51,0:33:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个没有谎言的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world without lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.86,0:33:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说的对  我们是欺骗了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. we lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.56,0:33:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我会告诉你真正的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.80,0:33:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过是  想  想告诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want...to tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.67,0:33:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.80,0:33:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想听听他想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to hear what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.37,0:33:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经强大地超出我想象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.78,0:33:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是骗了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.21,0:33:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.28,0:33:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在澄清下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.92,0:33:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.15,0:33:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我哥哥  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.36,0:33:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.51,0:33:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你自己就是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except when you are the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.45,0:33:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧  萨姆?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.68,0:33:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在那儿的女人  她叫茱莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that woman right there, her name is julia.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.75,0:33:50.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是你母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.36,0:33:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在和你说话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the thing inside of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.09,0:33:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她体内的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing that you're talking to --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.29,0:33:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那是恶魔  - 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a demon. - A demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.76,0:33:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你遇见他们那刻起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's done nothing but lie to you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.85,0:33:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都在骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the moment you met him
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.90,0:34:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.43,0:34:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惩罚他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.63,0:34:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down and shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.07,0:34:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's, uh, kind of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.81,0:34:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使与恶魔之间的大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}A war between angels and demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.01,0:34:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你也参与其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And... you're a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.85,0:34:21.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不过是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.25,0:34:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你愿意  就跟她走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go with her if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.19,0:34:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我阻止不了你  没人可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop you. no one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.09,0:34:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.86,0:34:30.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会导致成千上万的人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of people will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.83,0:34:33.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说我有一半恶魔血统  是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said i was half demon. is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.36,0:34:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.47,0:34:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你另一半仍是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're half human, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.67,0:34:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以做出正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.77,0:34:41.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定权在你  杰斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got choices, jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.84,0:34:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但一旦你选错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you make the wrong ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.37,0:34:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的余生都会后悔莫及\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll haunt you for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.81,0:34:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何你要告诉我这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you telling me this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.08,0:34:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我相信  就算当时我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because i have to believe someone can make the right choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.25,0:34:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终究有人能做出正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if i couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.69,0:35:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.78,0:35:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.31,0:35:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想着就做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.48,0:35:24.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.42,0:35:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.49,0:35:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会没事的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.83,0:35:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.81,0:35:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, uh, truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.34,0:35:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他算是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's kind of a buddy of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.25,0:36:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有办法把他变回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any way you could turn him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.41,0:36:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他曾试图杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.68,0:36:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.50,0:36:08.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他  他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's a -- he's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.22,0:36:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是一念之差\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.59,0:36:15.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.06,0:36:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况有些复杂  我们回头再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long night. we'll...talk about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.00,0:36:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.81,0:36:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们带你去到一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we take you someplace safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.97,0:36:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,训练你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get you trained up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.54,0:36:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得投入战斗了  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be handy in a fight, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.81,0:36:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不想战斗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if i don't want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.32,0:36:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.87,0:36:46.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.13,0:36:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我们所见过的所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}More powerful than...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.56,0:36:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要强大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much anything we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.13,0:36:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这也让你变成了  - 怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That makes you... - A freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.40,0:37:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对某些人来说  确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}To some people, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.17,0:37:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但对我们来说不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.18,0:37:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  从某种程度上来说  我们也是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we're kind of freaks ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.74,0:37:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能留在这了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stay here, can i?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.55,0:37:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.22,0:37:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔知道你在这儿  他们会成群结队地前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons know where you are, and more will be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.12,0:37:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会丢下我的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't go without my mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.99,0:37:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家人比什么都重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more important than family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.56,0:37:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我们明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.16,0:37:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真想带上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you really want to take them with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.13,0:37:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也没有意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll back your play.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.07,0:37:30.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你必须明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to understand --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.97,0:37:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样一来  他们也有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be dangerous for them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.42,0:37:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.64,0:37:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.68,0:37:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论他去哪儿  都会带上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would take us with him wherever he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.81,0:37:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他现在在哪儿  - 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he now? - Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.05,0:37:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被恶魔杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.12,0:37:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Jesse...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.33,0:37:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦你加入了战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you're in this fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.59,0:37:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就无法再回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you're in it till the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.19,0:37:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论结局是输还是赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Win or lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.46,0:37:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.96,0:38:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.27,0:38:02.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这得由你自己来选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.33,0:38:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.94,0:38:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能去见见我的父母吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I go see my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.68,0:38:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.68,0:38:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得和他们告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to...say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.15,0:39:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他上去很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been up there a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.63,0:39:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.20,0:39:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去了哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.30,0:39:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.27,0:39:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰斯把镇子上的人都恢复了原样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesse put everyone in town back to normal --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.50,0:39:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些受害者都还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.57,0:39:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.94,0:39:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.18,0:39:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面写了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.09,0:40:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他必须留下来保护他的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he had to leave to keep his parents safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.06,0:40:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他爱他们  他很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he loves them, and he's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.70,0:40:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样才能找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.10,0:40:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  那孩子具有强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the boy's powers, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.50,0:40:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非他自己想要被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless he wants to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.64,0:40:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢  杰斯会没事的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Jesse's gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.18,0:40:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.15,0:40:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  我们告诉他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we destroyed that kid's life
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.15,0:40:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当于毁了那孩子的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}By telling him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.76,0:40:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别无选择  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't have a choice, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.93,0:40:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.76,0:40:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我好想弄明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm starting to get
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.46,0:40:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么父母总是对孩子撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why parents lie to their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.53,0:40:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想让孩子相信  在这世上最坏的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want them to believe that the worst thing out there
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.44,0:40:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是混合跳跳糖和可乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is mixing pop rocks and coke --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.81,0:40:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样能保护他们免受真正邪恶的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect them from the real evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.24,0:40:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让他们能安心入睡的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want them going to bed feeling safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.71,0:41:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就必须骗他们  事实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that means lying to them, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.79,0:41:09.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我越是这样想  就越是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more i think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.89,0:41:12.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当年爸爸也对我们撒谎该多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more i wish dad had lied to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.63,0:41:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
